[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0010","text":"大家——！\n今天来参加甘奈她们的演唱会，谢谢大家——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0020","text":"……那、那个……\n有件事……想让大家听一听……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0030","text":"我们，\n倾注在这个舞台上的心意……主题……那就是——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0040","text":"甜、甜花……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0050","text":"呵呵\n我也正想说同样的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0060","text":"连千雪小姐都……！\n但是……如果那样做的话——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0070","text":"——工作人员那边，由我去沟通\n你们按自己的想法去做就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0080","text":"…………\n谢谢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0090","text":"那个啊，……把大家喜欢的东西\n一个一个说出来怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0100","text":"……嗯！\n甘奈，想听大家的喜欢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0110","text":"呵呵，那就从我开始……\n首先是“很多人的笑容”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0120","text":"嘿嘿……很有千雪小姐的风格……\n甜花是“游戏里，最高分”……幸福……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0130","text":"那接下来是甘奈……“翻相册的时候”\n……吧……制作人呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0140","text":"我也要参加吗……！\n那……“从舞台侧幕看舞台”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0150","text":"嘿嘿……／嘿嘿……\n呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0160","text":"“走向舞台的瞬间”“花的芳香”“新的梦”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0170","text":"“零食区”“牵起双手”\n“观众席里，满满的粉色光芒”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0180","text":"“忘记时间的聊天”“要好的对手”\n“交叠的歌声”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0190","text":"“Alstroemeria”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_99_0200","text":"“我们的未来”"}]
